  "html": "<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col col-8\"><h2>Ply-by-Ply Tape Laminator</h2><figure><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Ply-by-Ply-TL-b.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><div class=\"center\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\n<li>Combines Accudyne placement heads with proprietary customer process</li>\n<li>4 CNC controlled heads</li>\n<li>Moving tool with “fixed” heads</li>\n<li>Stringers up to 75 ft (22.9m) long</li>\n<li>25 degrees of freedom</li>\n<li>Strain rate controlled forming</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"col col-4\">\n\t\t\t<nav class=\"side-nav\"><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Automated Tape Laying</h3><ul><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/automated-tape-laminator/\">Automated Tape Laminator</a></li><li class=\"current\"><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/ply-by-ply-tape-laminator/\">Ply-by-Ply Tape Laminator</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/tp-staker-laminator/\">Thermoplastic Staker / Laminator</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/electron-beam-tape-laminator/\">Electron Beam Tape Laminator</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/insitu-thermoplastic-laminator-i/\">Insitu Thermoplastic Laminator I</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/insitu-thermoplastic-laminator-ii/\">Insitu Thermoplastic Laminator II</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-tape-laying/lab-scale-atl-machine/\">Lab-Scale ATL Machine</a></li></ul></nav>\n</div></div><h3>Machine Images</h3><div class=\"gallery\"><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Ply-by-Ply-TL-b.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Ply-by-Ply-TL-b-300x239.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"239\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Ply-by-Ply-TL-a.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Ply-by-Ply-TL-a-300x235.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"235\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>"
